{
  "slug": "autocode",
  "name": "Autocode",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "You say it, AutoCode ships it. 47 AI-powered skills that take complete beginners from zero to a live website. AI makes all technical decisions, user just says yes or no. Includes environment setup, coding, deployment, domain binding, SSL, and go-live verification. Powered by I-Lang v3.0 protocol. Free forever.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **47 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (47): `ask-smart` (Before coding, determine what to ask), `auto-quality` (Silent quality check after every feature), `best-choice` (When multiple solutions exist, pick the best one), `build-feature` (Build one feature at a time), `build-scaffold` (Create project skeleton), `build-ui` (Build user-facing interface), `celebrate` (Celebrate real milestones only), `clarify-scope` (Classify request as small/medium/large), and 39 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install autocode@claude-community` from `ilang-ai/autocode`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "I-Lang Research, Eastsoft Inc.",
    "url": "https://github.com/ilang-ai/autocode"
